# Title: Exchange PowerShell Snap-Ins Usage
# ID: 25676e10-2121-446e-80a4-71ff8506af47
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: FPT.EagleEye, Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2021-03-03
# Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1059.001, attack.collection, attack.t1114
# Description: Detects adding and using Exchange PowerShell snap-ins to export mailbox data. As seen used by HAFNIUM and APT27
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((@CommandLine:*Add-PSSnapin*) AND (((@Image:*\\powershell.exe OR @Image:*\\pwsh.exe)) OR ((@OriginalFileName:"PowerShell.EXE" OR @OriginalFileName:"pwsh.dll"))) AND ((@CommandLine:*Microsoft.Exchange.Powershell.Snapin* OR @CommandLine:*Microsoft.Exchange.Management.PowerShell.SnapIn*))) AND -((@ParentImage:"C:\\Windows\\System32\\msiexec.exe" AND @CommandLine:*$exserver=Get-ExchangeServer ([Environment]::MachineName) -ErrorVariable exerr 2> $null*)))
